---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — Cosmetiqly"
  description="Cosmetiqly privacy policy detailing data practices, server logging, cookie usage, and user rights."
  canonicalPath="/privacy"
>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
    <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-slate-500 mb-6">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-slate-900">Home</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <span class="text-slate-700 font-medium">Privacy</span>
    </nav>

    <header class="mb-8 pb-4 border-b border-slate-200">
      <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Effective Date: November 13, 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-6">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">1. Overview</h2>
        <p>
          Cosmetiqly values your privacy. We operate an educational search database. We do not require account registration, do not maintain user profiles, and do not sell personal data.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">2. Information Collection</h2>
        <p>
          When you access Cosmetiqly, our edge network (Cloudflare) collects standard HTTP request data, including IP address, user-agent string, and requested URLs, exclusively for DDoS protection, caching performance, and operational security.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">3. Cookies &amp; Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          We may use minimal aggregated analytics to measure platform performance, site latency, and search demand. We do not engage in cross-site behavioural tracking.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
